"_____ had I sat down when the phone rang.", "options": ["No sooner", "Hardly", "Never", "Rarely"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 15, "question": "The company''s profits have increased _____ over the last year.", "options": ["significant", "significantly", "significance", "significate"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 16, "question": "We _____ dinner when the power went out.", "options": ["had", "were having", "have had", "has"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 17, "question": "You''d better _____ an umbrella, it looks like rain.", "options": ["take", "to take", "taking", "took"], "correct_index": 0}, {"num": 18, "question": "She''s the person _____ helped me with my application.", "options": ["who", "whose", "which", "whom"], "correct_index": 0}, {"num": 19, "question": "I would rather you _____ smoke in here.", "options": ["don''t", "didn''t", "won''t", "not"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 20, "question": "The building _____ next to the station was built in 1990.", "options": ["locate", "located", "locating", "is locate"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 21, "question": "Neither the manager nor the employees _____ satisfied with the decision.", "options": ["was", "were", "is", "has been"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 22, "question": "I''ve _____ finished the report; I just need to check it once more.", "options": ["already", "yet", "still", "ago"], "correct_index": 0}, {"num": 23, "question": "Despite _____ hard, he failed the exam.", "options": ["study", "studying", "studied", "to study"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 24, "question": "The candidate seems very confident, _____ she is quite nervous.", "options": ["despite", "although", "because", "so"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 25, "question": "It is believed that the CEO _____ resign next month.", "options": ["will", "would", "should have", "has to"], "correct_index": 0}, {"num": 26, "question": "I can''t find my phone anywhere. I _____ left it at the restaurant.", "options": ["must", "must have", "should", "can"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 27, "question": "The report needs to be submitted _____ Friday at the latest.", "options": ["until", "by", "since", "for"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 28, "question": "He''s the kind of person who always _____ things done.", "options": ["get", "gets", "getting", "got"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 29, "question": "What _____ is a quiet place to concentrate.", "options": ["I need", "do I need", "I am needing", "needed I"], "correct_index": 0}, {"num": 30, "question": "The negotiations fell _____ at the last minute.", "options": ["through", "out", "up", "down"], "correct_index": 0}], "part_b": [{"title": "Email professionnel", "passage": "Subject: Meeting rescheduled  Dear team, Due to a scheduling conflict, tomorrow''s project review meeting has been moved from 10am to 2pm. Please make sure to bring your updated progress reports. If you cannot attend at the new time, let me know by the end of the day so we can find an alternative. The meeting room has also changed — we will now be in Conference Room B instead of Room A. Best regards, Laura", "questions": [{"num": 31, "question": "Why was the meeting rescheduled?", "options": ["The room was unavailable", "There was a scheduling conflict", "Laura was sick", "The team requested it"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 32, "question": "What time is the meeting now?", "options": ["10am", "12pm", "2pm", "4pm"], "correct_index": 2}, {"num": 33, "question": "What should attendees bring?", "options": ["Their laptops", "Progress reports", "Contracts", "Nothing specific"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 34, "question": "What should someone do if they can''t attend?", "options": ["Ignore the email", "Send a report anyway", "Inform Laura by end of day", "Reschedule themselves"], "correct_index": 2}, {"num": 35, "question": "Where will the meeting take place?", "options": ["Room A", "Conference Room B", "Online", "Not specified"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 36, "question": "Who sent this email?", "options": ["The whole team", "A client", "Laura", "The IT department"], "correct_index": 2}]}, {"title": "Annonce", "passage": "GRAND OPENING — Riverside Café Join us this Saturday from 9am to 6pm for the opening of our new café on Riverside Street! Enjoy free coffee samples, live music, and a 20% discount on all pastries all day long. Kids under 12 eat free with a paying adult. See you there!", "questions": [{"num": 37, "question": "What time does the event start?", "options": ["6am", "9am", "12pm", "6pm"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 38, "question": "What discount is offered?", "options": ["10% on coffee", "20% on pastries", "50% on everything", "No discount"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 39, "question": "What''s included for free?", "options": ["Live music tickets", "Coffee samples", "Parking", "Desserts"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 40, "question": "What''s the offer for children?", "options": ["Free entry", "Free drinks", "Free food with a paying adult", "No special offer"], "correct_index": 2}, {"num": 41, "question": "Where is the event happening?", "options": ["Downtown", "Riverside Street", "A shopping mall", "Not mentioned"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 42, "question": "What day is the event?", "options": ["Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday", "Every day this week"], "correct_index": 1}]}, {"title": "Article court", "passage": "Remote work has changed the way companies operate. A recent survey found that 68% of employees prefer a hybrid model, combining office and home work. However, managers report challenges in maintaining team communication and company culture. Some companies have responded by organizing monthly in-person events to strengthen team bonds.", "questions": [{"num": 43, "question": "What percentage of employees prefer hybrid work?", "options": ["32%", "50%", "68%", "100%"], "correct_index": 2}, {"num": 44, "question": "What challenge do managers mention?", "options": ["Salary costs", "Team communication", "Office space", "Technology issues"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 45, "question": "What solution have some companies adopted?", "options": ["Ending remote work", "Monthly in-person events", "Reducing salaries", "Hiring more managers"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 46, "question": "According to the text, what has changed?", "options": ["Employee salaries", "The way companies operate", "Office locations", "Working hours"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 47, "question": "What kind of work model is mentioned as preferred?", "options": ["Fully remote", "Fully in-office", "Hybrid", "Freelance"], "correct_index": 2}, {"num": 48, "question": "What is the purpose of the in-person events?", "options": ["Save money", "Strengthen team bonds", "Replace remote work", "Train new employees"], "correct_index": 1}]}, {"title": "Instructions", "passage": "How to reset your password: 1. Go to the login page and click \"Forgot password.\" 2. Enter the email address associated with your account. 3. Check your inbox for a reset link (it may take a few minutes to arrive). 4. Click the link and choose a new password with at least 8 characters. 5. Log in with your new password. If you still have trouble, contact support.", "questions": [{"num": 49, "question": "What is the first step?", "options": ["Enter your email", "Click \"Forgot password\"", "Check your inbox", "Contact support"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 50, "question": "What might take a few minutes?", "options": ["Creating an account", "The reset link arriving", "Logging in", "Changing your email"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 51, "question": "What is the minimum password length required?", "options": ["6 characters", "8 characters", "10 characters", "Not specified"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 52, "question": "What should you do if you still have trouble?", "options": ["Try again later", "Contact support", "Create a new account", "Restart your computer"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 53, "question": "Where do you click \"Forgot password\"?", "options": ["In your email", "On the login page", "In the app settings", "On the support page"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 54, "question": "What do you need to provide in step 2?", "options": ["Your phone number", "Your email address", "Your old password", "Your username"], "correct_index": 1}]}, {"title": "Avis client", "passage": "I recently stayed at this hotel for a business trip and overall I was quite satisfied. The room was clean and comfortable, and the staff were very helpful, especially at check-in. My only complaint is that the breakfast options were quite limited, and the wifi was slow in my room. I would still recommend it for short stays, but maybe not for a longer trip.", "questions": [{"num": 55, "question": "What was the reviewer''s overall impression?", "options": ["Very negative", "Quite satisfied", "Neutral", "Extremely disappointed"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 56, "question": "What did the reviewer like?", "options": ["The breakfast", "The wifi", "The staff", "The price"], "correct_index": 2}, {"num": 57, "question": "What was the main complaint?", "options": ["Dirty room", "Rude staff", "Limited breakfast and slow wifi", "High prices"], "correct_index": 2}, {"num": 58, "question": "Would the reviewer recommend the hotel?", "options": ["No, never", "Yes, for short stays", "Yes, for long stays only", "Not mentioned"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 59, "question": "What was the purpose of the trip?", "options": ["Vacation", "Business", "Family visit", "Not mentioned"], "correct_index": 1}, {"num": 60, "question": "Where was the wifi problem noticed?", "options": ["In the lobby", "In the room", "In the restaurant", "Everywhere in the hotel"], "correct_index": 1}]}]}'::jsonb
